  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Timor-Leste 2023 Short Term Scholarships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to increase the knowledge and skills of individuals so that they can contribute to the development of Timor-Leste and positively impact the bilateral relationship by providing short term scholarships (less than one year in length) to scholars from Timor-Leste. These short term scholarships can take the form of vocational training, an apprenticeship, or other workplace experience.</narrative>
  </description>
